{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/89bb9203cbef62fc338689f8f82d6668.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lonesome Guild is a single-player top-down action-RPG all about togetherness. Embark on a heroic adventure as Ghost, a spirit who wakes to find they hold no memories. The world has become shrouded by loneliness and the mist just keeps spreading, corrupting everyone in its path. Now it\u2019s up to you to get the band back together... even if they\u2019re meeting for the first time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/fd7c1cec18aee95e0f996cc24f7ac0dc.poster.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/fd7c1cec18aee95e0f996cc24f7ac0dc.webm?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/fd7c1cec18aee95e0f996cc24f7ac0dc.mp4?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/aca6dbfaee49a32b64032b7d3f8f989d.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ragtag group of unlikely friends you\u2019ll recruit each will bring their own story, quirks, motives, and abilities. Switch seamlessly between the 6 of them during exploration and combat to navigate Etere, solve puzzles, and defeat enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/0c156aa89970d9ccc862164f44ddd25e.poster.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/0c156aa89970d9ccc862164f44ddd25e.webm?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/0c156aa89970d9ccc862164f44ddd25e.mp4?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/37de15592ab3d89ea8cf750f31a7647c.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relationships are the heart and soul of The Lonesome Guild \u2013 it\u2019s a party, literally. As your friendship grows, so does your power with new abilities and combos. A party can only be strong if each member is strong too \u2013 unravel your new friends\u2019 stories and help them find peace. Unlock side quests, new abilities, and heartfelt chats by the campfire. Together, we\u2019re unstoppable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/3af2fa17b8c606427419d99600d5888e.poster.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/3af2fa17b8c606427419d99600d5888e.webm?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/3af2fa17b8c606427419d99600d5888e.mp4?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/9ff67d0eed0ca4d9d6a938e5100ba6b5.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels, a roster of cool abilities, one very powerful Ghost power. Test your might in intense battles where you can switch between characters whenever you fancy and ambush enemies with clever combos. Build your dream team and fight your way through Etere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/d98f81dc109ed417862b77ce5b914ff2.poster.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/d98f81dc109ed417862b77ce5b914ff2.webm?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/d98f81dc109ed417862b77ce5b914ff2.mp4?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/a0312d7c939716dcad256de1128f58b5.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=118 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Etere is full of charm and secrets, mystery and treasures to uncover. From unearthing old secrets in the ruins to gathering round campfires in the forest, there\u2019s always something new around the corner in The Lonesome Guild. Solve puzzles, explore vibrant landscapes, and find shiny things as you restore balance and hope to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/51a65d1a10b179ec5821d0975779bb17.poster.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/51a65d1a10b179ec5821d0975779bb17.webm?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/51a65d1a10b179ec5821d0975779bb17.mp4?t=1760623001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/eb7666205ffca20e738ed903113b1c5b.avif?t=1760623001\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1486450?t=1760623001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760623001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/f225e30de22184733a586a1c584aff9aae144950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760623001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/f225e30de22184733a586a1c584aff9aae144950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760623001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img